 "kiahk-distribution-hymn-1": {
  "coptic": "Ⲁⲗⲗⲏⲗⲟⲩⲓⲁ.\n\nⲤ̀ⲙⲟⲩ ⲉ̀Ⲫϯ ϧⲉⲛ ⲛⲏⲉ̅ⲑ̅ⲩ̅ ⲧⲏⲣⲟⲩ ⲛ̀ⲧⲁϥ.\n\n+ Ⲥ̀ⲙⲟⲩ ⲉ̀ⲣⲟϥ ϧⲉⲛ ⲡⲓⲧⲁϫⲣⲟ ⲛ̀ⲧⲉ ⲧⲉϥϫⲟⲙ.\n\nⲤ̀ⲙⲟⲩ ⲉ̀ⲣⲟϥ ⲉ̀ϩ̀ⲣⲏⲓ ϩⲓϫⲉⲛ ⲧⲉϥⲙⲉⲧϫⲱⲣⲓ.\n\n+ Ⲥ̀ⲙⲟⲩ ⲉ̀ⲣⲟϥ ⲕⲁⲧⲁ ⲡ̀ⲁ̀ϣⲁⲓ ⲛ̀ⲧⲉ ⲧⲉϥⲙⲉⲧⲛⲓϣϯ.\n\nⲤ̀ⲙⲟⲩ ⲉ̀ⲣⲟϥ ϧⲉⲛ ⲟⲩⲥ̀ⲙⲏ ⲛ̀ⲥⲁⲗⲡⲓⲅⲅⲟⲥ.\n\n+ Ⲥ̀ⲙⲟⲩ ⲉ̀ⲣⲟϥ ϧⲉⲛ ⲟⲩⲯⲁⲗⲧⲏⲣⲓⲟⲛ ⲛⲉⲙ ⲟⲩⲕⲩⲑⲁⲣⲁ.\n\nⲤ̀ⲙⲟⲩ ⲉ̀ⲣⲟϥ ϧⲉⲛ ϩⲁⲛⲕⲉⲙⲕⲉⲙ ⲛⲉⲙ ϩⲁⲛⲭⲟⲣⲟⲥ.\n\n+ Ⲥ̀ⲙⲟⲩ ⲉ̀ⲣⲟϥ ϧⲉⲛ ϩⲁⲛⲕⲁⲡ ⲛⲉⲙ ⲟⲩⲟⲣⲅⲁⲛⲟⲛ.\n\nⲤ̀ⲙⲟⲩ ⲉ̀ⲣⲟϥ ϧⲉⲛ ϩⲁⲛⲕⲩⲙⲃⲁⲗⲟⲛ ⲉ̀ⲛⲉⲥⲉ ⲧⲟⲩⲥ̀ⲙⲏ.\n\n+ Ⲥ̀ⲙⲟⲩ ⲉ̀ⲣⲟϥ ϧⲉⲛ ϩⲁⲛⲕⲩⲙⲃⲁⲗⲟⲛ ⲛ̀ⲧⲉ ⲟⲩⲉ̀ϣ̀ⲗⲏⲗⲟⲩⲓ̀.\n\nⲚⲓϥⲓ ⲛⲓⲃⲉⲛ ⲙⲁⲣⲟⲩⲥ̀ⲙⲟⲩ ⲧⲏⲣⲟⲩ ⲉ̀ⲫ̀ⲣⲁⲛ ⲙ̀Ⲡⲟ̅ⲥ̅ ⲡⲉⲛⲛⲟⲩϯ.\n\n+ Ⲇⲟⲝⲁ Ⲡⲁⲧⲣⲓ ⲕⲉ Ⲩ̀ⲓⲱ̀ ⲕⲉ ⲁ̀ⲅⲓⲱ̀ Ⲡ̀ⲛⲉⲩⲙⲁⲧⲓ.\n\nⲔⲉ ⲛⲩⲛ ⲕⲉ ⲁ̀ⲓ̀ ⲕⲉ ⲓⲥ ⲧⲟⲩⲥ ⲉ̀ⲱ̀ⲛⲁⲥ ⲧⲱⲛ ⲉ̀ⲱ̀ⲛⲱⲛ ⲁ̀ⲙⲏⲛ.\n\n+ Ⲁⲗⲗⲏⲗⲟⲩⲓⲁ ⲁ̅ⲗ̅: ⲇⲟⲝⲁ ⲥⲓ ⲟ Ⲑⲉⲟⲥ ⲏ̀ⲙⲱⲛ.\n\nⲀⲗⲗⲏⲗⲟⲩⲓⲁ ⲁ̅ⲗ̅: ⲡⲓⲱ̀ⲟⲩ ⲫⲁ ⲡⲉⲛⲚⲟⲩϯ ⲡⲉ.\n\n+ Ⲓⲏ̅ⲥ̅ Ⲡⲭ̅ⲥ̅ ⲡ̀Ϣⲏⲣⲓ ⲙ̀Ⲫϯ ⲥⲱⲧⲉⲙ ⲉ̀ⲣⲟⲛ ⲟⲩⲟϩ ⲛⲁⲓ ⲛⲁⲛ.",
  "englishCoptic": "Alleelouia.\n\nEsmou e-efnoti khen nee-ethowab teerou entaf.\n\n+ Esmou erof khen pitagro ente tefgom.\n\nEsmou erof e-ehree hijen tefmetgori.\n\n+ Esmou erof kata epashai ente tefmetnishti.\n\nEsmou erof khen ou-esmee ensalpinghos.\n\n+ Esmou erof khen oupsalteerion nem oukithara.\n\nEsmou erof khen hankemkem nem hankhoros.\n\n+ Esmou erof khen hankap nem o-orghanon.\n\nEsmou erof khen hankimvalon enese tou-esmee.\n\n+ Esmou erof khen hankimvalon ente o-e-eshleeloui.\n\nNifi niven marou-esmou teerou e-efran emepshois pennoti.\n\n+ Thoksa Patri ke I-i-o ke agi-o Epnevmati.\n\nKe nin ke a-i ke is tous e-onas ton e-onon ameen.\n\n+ Alleelouia alleelouia: thoksa si o Theos eemon.\n\nAlleelouia alleelouia: pi-oou fa pennoti pe.\n\n+ Ieesous Pi-ekhristos epsheeri emefnoti sotem eron o-woh nai nan.",
  "english": "Alleluia.\n\nPraise God in all His saints.\n\n+ Praise Him in the firmament of His power.\n\nPraise Him for His mighty acts.\n\n+ Praise Him according to the multitudes of His greatness.\n\nPraise Him with the sound of the trumpet.\n\n+ Praise Him with psaltery and harp.\n\nPraise Him with timbrel and chorus.\n\n+ Praise Him with strings and organs.\n\nPraise Him with pleasant sounding cymbals.\n\n+ Praise Him upon the cymbals of joy.\n\nLet every thing that has breath praise the name of the Lord our God.\n\n+ Glory be to the Father, and the Son and the Holy Spirit.\n\nNow and forever and unto the age of all ages Amen.\n\n+ Alleluia, Alleluia, glory be to our God.\n\nAlleluia, Alleluia, glory be to our God.\n\n+ O Jesus Christ, the Son of God, hear us and have mercy upon us.",
  "englishArabic": "Hallelouia.\n\nSabbihou Allah fi gamee' qiddiseeh.\n\n+ Sabbihouhu fi galad quwwatih.\n\nSabbihouhu 'ala maqdaratih.\n\n+ Sabbihouhu ka-kathrat 'azamatih.\n\nSabbihouhu bi-sawt el-bouq.\n\n+ Sabbihouhu bil-mizmar wal-qeethar.\n\nSabbihouhu bi-dufouf wa sufouf.\n\n+ Sabbihouhu bi-awtar wa arghan.\n\nSabbihouhu bi-sunoug hasanat es-sawt.\n\n+ Sabbihouhu bi-sunoug et-tahleel.\n\nKull nasama fal-tusabbih ism er-Rabb ilahina.\n\n+ El-magd lil-Ab wal-Ibn war-Rouh el-Qudus.\n\nEl-an wa kull awan wa ila dahr ed-dahireen, ameen.\n\n+ El-magd li-ilahina, hallelouia.\n\nEl-magd li-ilahina, hallelouia.\n\n+ Ya Yasou' el-Maseeh Ibn Allah, isma'na warhamna.",
  "arabic": "هلليلويا.\n\nسبحوا الله في جميع قديسيه.\n\n+ سبحوه في جلد قوته.\n\nسبحوه على مقدرته.\n\n+ سبحوه ككثرة عظمته.\n\nسبحوه بصوت البوق.\n\n+ سبحوه بالمزمار والقيثار.\n\nسبحوه بدفوف وصفوف.\n\n+ سبحوه بأوتار وأرغن.\n\nسبحوه بصنوج حسنة الصوت.\n\n+ سبحوه بصنوج التهليل.\n\nكل نسمة فلتسبح اسم الرب الهنا.\n\n+ المجد للآب والأبن والروح القدس.\n\nالآن وكل أوان وإلى دهر الداهرين آمين.\n\n+ المجد لإلهنا هلليلويا.\n\nالمجد لإلهنا هلليلويا.\n\n+ يا يسوع المسيح ابن الله، إسمعنا وإرحمنا."
 },
 "annual-distribution-psalm-150@nativity-distribution": {
  "englishArabic": "Yasou' el-Maseeh ebn Allah, wulid fi Bayt Lahm.\n\nSabbihou Allah fi qiddiseeh, hallelouia.\n\nYasou' el-Maseeh ebn Allah, wulid fi Bayt Lahm.\n\nSabbihouhu fi galad quwwatih. Hallelouia.\n\nYasou' el-Maseeh ebn Allah, wulid fi Bayt Lahm.\n\nSabbihouhu 'ala maqdaratih. Hallelouia.\n\nYasou' el-Maseeh ebn Allah, wulid fi Bayt Lahm.\n\nSabbihouhu ka-kathrat 'azamatih. Hallelouia.\n\nYasou' el-Maseeh ebn Allah, wulid fi Bayt Lahm.\n\nSabbihou sawt el-bouq, hallelouia.\n\nYasou' el-Maseeh ebn Allah, wulid fi Bayt Lahm.\n\nSabbihouhu bi-mizmar wa qeethar. Hallelouia.\n\nYasou' el-Maseeh ebn Allah, wulid fi Bayt Lahm.\n\nSabbihou bi-dufouf wa sufouf, hallelouia.\n\nYasou' el-Maseeh ebn Allah, wulid fi Bayt Lahm.\n\nSabbihouhu bi-awtar wa arghan. Hallelouia.\n\nYasou' el-Maseeh ebn Allah, wulid fi Bayt Lahm.\n\nSabbihou bi-sunoug hasanat es-sawt, hallelouia.\n\nYasou' el-Maseeh ebn Allah, wulid fi Bayt Lahm.\n\nSabbihouhu bi-sunoug et-tahleel. Hallelouia.\n\nYasou' el-Maseeh ebn Allah, wulid fi Bayt Lahm.\n\nKull nasama fal-tusabbih ism er-Rabb ilahina. Hallelouia.\n\nYasou' el-Maseeh ebn Allah, wulid fi Bayt Lahm.\n\nEl-magd lil-Ab wal-Ibn war-Rouh el-Qudus. Hallelouia.\n\nYasou' el-Maseeh ebn Allah, wulid fi Bayt Lahm.\n\nEl-an wa kull awan wa ila dahr ed-duhour. Ameen. Hallelouia.\n\nYasou' el-Maseeh ebn Allah, wulid fi Bayt Lahm.\n\nEl-magd laka ya ilahana, hallelouia.\n\nEl-magd huwa li-ilahina. Hallelouia.\n\nYa Yasou' el-Maseeh Ibn Allah, isma'na warhamna.\n\nMubarakun anta bil-haqeeqa, ma'a abeeka es-salih war-Rouh el-Qudus, li-annaka ateet wa khallastana."
 },
